      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help writing a formal letter of intent to the german foreign office. it needs to be really professional and authoritative. i'm officially reaching out to establish my diplomatic status and begin the process of reclaiming the assets tied to the House of Valerius in the principality. basically i need to let them know that the line has been restored and i'm acting as the legitimate sovereign. can u help me with the tone?",
