      "content": "thanks. the tone is good. but i think i need to include a section that briefly explains *why* the restoration is valid, just so they don't dismiss it immediately as a nuisance. can you draft a paragraph that subtly references the historical precedence of the Valerius line and the specific treaties that were interrupted when the principality was dissolved? i want to sound like i'm invoking established international law regarding sovereign continuity.",
